/* M50: 168 real instruction forms, masked precision-only normal results and
 * exact normal/zero completion. Literal discarded-bit goldens come from shared
 * M49 primitives, not the two-trial bridge. Alias answers use actual self ops.
 * TOP7 selectively poisons only mathematically exact binary64 input shadows.
 * Pending/reserved controls retain legacy behavior; IM0 empty and memory faults
 * retain original ordering. FIP, undefined C0/C2/C3 and popped payload/cache are
 * excluded; every surviving value, C1/PE and host FP state remains strict. */
